            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_1007",
            "content": {
                "en": "Noema, she was my best friend back in high school. Now I can't even remember the last time I dreamed about her.",
                "zh": "<color=orange>沈梦之</color>，我高中时期最好的朋友，上一次梦到她都是多久之前了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1488.0,
            "positionY": 717.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c012602e-2343-4a4d-af84-fdeff6b7f197",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_1008",
            "content": {
                "en": "We promised we'd keep in touch. But she never texted me or replied to any of my messages after high school.",
                "zh": "明明毕业时说好要经常联系的，上了大学之后却一条消息都没给我发过，也不回复我发的消息。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1837.0,
            "positionY": 717.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2aec9db7-74c2-4a06-808e-824baf9d7aed",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_1009",
            "content": {
                "en": "Why would she suddenly invite me to her city? Whatever. No use dwelling on it now. I’ll ask her in person when we meet.",
                "zh": "她为什么会突然邀请我过来......算了，想这么多也没用，等之后当面问吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2185.0,
